   "body": "/claim mac/M1\n- Locate where the reading top is saved/restored around a reload and confirm the zoom-scale mix-up.\n- Model the restore as a pure computation (zoom scale, offset, anchor) with a test seen red first.\n- Fix at the class level (convert viewport points to layout points), no change to TopicReaderView/ReaderWebView.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
